# The large downloads and the tables derived from them stay out of git; the scripts that fetch
# them, the provenance sidecars, the request keys and the small summary tables are tracked.
# `centroids.csv` and `gardens.csv` are small but derived from catalogues that state no licence
# or a GPL one.
era5/*.nc
twentycr/*/*.nc
gbif/*/*.zip
gbif/*/*.csv
*.part
records*.csv
record_climate.csv
centroids.csv
gardens.csv
evi/*.hdf
evi/*.nc
